[14.131351, "o", "ℹ fail 0\r\n"]
[14.150239, "o", "[exit 0]\r\n\r\n== The full path of M9: a fact is forgotten during a task, and the runner is killed\r\n"]
[14.150563, "o", "\r\n$ cd apps/launcher && npx tsx --test --test-concurrency=1 test-e2e/memory.test.ts 2>&1 | grep -E '^(✔|✖)|^ℹ (tests|fail)'\r\n"]
[20.639481, "o", "✔ M9: a fact in the brief is forgotten during the task, the runner is killed, and the model requests of the new attempt do not have the text (5867.785926ms)\r\n"]
[21.196273, "o", "ℹ tests 1\r\n"]
[21.19635, "o", "ℹ fail 0\r\n"]
[21.213976, "o", "[exit 0]\r\n"]
[21.214016, "o", "\r\n== The demo: npm run dev:platform runs in a second terminal. A search in Arabic, a forget and an undo.\r\n"]
[25.727866, "o", "\r\n"]
[25.728289, "o", "$ DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:spike@127.0.0.1:5433/ts_demo npm run demo:memory --silent\r\n"]
[26.185766, "o", "== The owner keeps a fact on the page customers: \"أحمد يفضل القهوة العربية\"\r\n"]
[26.21526, "o", "POST /v1/commands OwnerMessage \"remember on customers: أحمد يفضل القهوة العربية\" -> 200\r\n"]
[26.3744, "o", "fact cmd/remember-1795078058878/fact: status current\r\n"]
[26.374744, "o", "\r\n== A task with the goal \"اخبر احمد عن القَهوة\": \"احمد\" has a plain alef, and \"القَهوة\" has a diacritic\r\n"]
[26.439006, "o", "POST /v1/commands OwnerMessage \"اخبر احمد عن القَهوة\" -> 200\r\n"]
[27.605952, "o", "   cmd/remember-1795078058878/fact: أحمد يفضل القهوة العربية\r\n\r\n== The owner forgets the fact\r\n"]
[27.639165, "o", "POST /v1/commands ForgetFact -> 200\r\n"]
[27.692169, "o", "fact cmd/remember-1795078058878/fact: status forgotten\r\n"]
[27.692598, "o", "A new task with the same goal:\r\n"]
[27.716904, "o", "POST /v1/commands OwnerMessage \"اخبر احمد عن القَهوة\" -> 200\r\n"]
[28.809962, "o", "   (no fact in the brief)\r\n\r\n== The owner undoes the forget\r\n"]
[28.842945, "o", "POST /v1/commands UndoForget -> 200\r\n"]
[29.868316, "o", "fact cmd/remember-1795078058878/fact: status current\r\n"]
[29.868637, "o", "A new task with the same goal:\r\n"]
[29.899176, "o", "POST /v1/commands OwnerMessage \"اخبر احمد عن القَهوة\" -> 200\r\n"]
[32.1068, "o", "   cmd/remember-1795078058878/fact: أحمد يفضل القهوة العربية\r\n"]
[32.122369, "o", "[exit 0]\r\n"]
